{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Cosmo Cheats at Poker",
    "steam_appid": 2479950,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479950/extras/0c3d3c383618743cefe15233978a1a4b.avif?t=1701559701\" /></span><br><br>Ultra-long-haul space trucking doesn't normally provide much entertainment, but Cosmo has a nose for trouble \u2013 and a nose for poker games in particular. Luckily for him, the locals along Interstellar-81 are always up for a game. They just don't need to know about the ace up his sleeve...<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHEAT </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Use your deck of cheat cards to change your hand, change the river, or even exchange hands with opponents<br></li><li>Build your deck of cheats with experience as you play<br></li><li>Test your cunning against local cheaters, like Frankie &quot;The Ace&quot; and &quot;Short Line&quot; Larry</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479950/extras/ddbcc7a166b18dffe2852a1a3f0af995.avif?t=1701559701\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Travel to sunbaked planetoids and humid moons<br></li><li>See renowned local landmarks like the Black Hole Donut Shop or the Giant Tire Pile<br></li><li>Hunt down secrets in the hidden corners of Asteroid County</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479950/extras/91ba4f9f0bd376e64b1e11ce8b6a3209.avif?t=1701559701\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RAISE THE STAKES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Win at small-time tables to build your reputation and get access to higher-stakes games<br></li><li>Upgrade your truck to check out new pit-stops<br></li><li>Mosey on over to New Reno Station and compete in the 78th Annual Truck Pull and Poker Tournament against the most notorious cheaters in the county!</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479950/extras/ed6f22dd594c9a9002d0368fe6c0f4d2.avif?t=1701559701\" /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479950/extras/0c3d3c383618743cefe15233978a1a4b.avif?t=1701559701\" /></span><br><br>Ultra-long-haul space trucking doesn't normally provide much entertainment, but Cosmo has a nose for trouble \u2013 and a nose for poker games in particular. Luckily for him, the locals along Interstellar-81 are always up for a game. They just don't need to know about the ace up his sleeve...<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHEAT </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Use your deck of cheat cards to change your hand, change the river, or even exchange hands with opponents<br></li><li>Build your deck of cheats with experience as you play<br></li><li>Test your cunning against local cheaters, like Frankie &quot;The Ace&quot; and &quot;Short Line&quot; Larry</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479950/extras/ddbcc7a166b18dffe2852a1a3f0af995.avif?t=1701559701\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Travel to sunbaked planetoids and humid moons<br></li><li>See renowned local landmarks like the Black Hole Donut Shop or the Giant Tire Pile<br></li><li>Hunt down secrets in the hidden corners of Asteroid County</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479950/extras/91ba4f9f0bd376e64b1e11ce8b6a3209.avif?t=1701559701\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RAISE THE STAKES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Win at small-time tables to build your reputation and get access to higher-stakes games<br></li><li>Upgrade your truck to check out new pit-stops<br></li><li>Mosey on over to New Reno Station and compete in the 78th Annual Truck Pull and Poker Tournament against the most notorious cheaters in the county!</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479950/extras/ed6f22dd594c9a9002d0368fe6c0f4d2.avif?t=1701559701\" /></span>",
